{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0022_1001_p", "source_sha256": "657a65b964f538a29717c241981cc2bc642036fa74d81b7e0174f428e2870e52", "ja": "この前の撮影のことか。\n響によく似合っていて、かわいかったぞ。", "zh": "你是说之前的拍摄吗？\n那套服装很适合响，非常可爱喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
