{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0022_1003_p", "source_sha256": "42de77a514c7b7610ff14d2dcc4c27fe16709d7a57ed11863da07d5fdadcdd11", "ja": "そうだったのか。それでも、あんなにかわいいとは……\nさすが、響はカンペキだな！", "zh": "原来是这样吗？即使如此，居然还能那么可爱……\n真不愧是响，很完美呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0022_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "2812e3cf95e5615a50a81270e87ad9bd24b9aa2e8a4665e16d0135b44aa65574", "ja": "えっ……？　う、うんっ。自分はカンペキだぞっ。\nよくわかってるね、{$P$}。", "zh": "咦……？呃、嗯，本人很完美喔。\n你很懂嘛，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0022_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8e071e2b5f5992b01b557f1bceb8eebe51d66e56f85eaeeaf2fabbbffbea9be6", "ja": "カンペキな響でないと、あの服は着こなせないかもな。\n今度はステージでも、着てもらっていいか？", "zh": "除了完美的响以外，恐怕没有人能配得上那套服装了。\n下次的表演，也可以请你穿那套服装上场吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0022_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "58462e05ee9c108289f7c336d6c3f88df02951cc8a0e1a946cef3c1bd9196c2e", "ja": "ふふんっ、どんな衣装でもなんくるないさー！\n……あれ？　ねえ、なんか自分……だまされてない？", "zh": "哼哼，不管什么服装都总会有办法的啦～！\n……咦？欸，感觉本人……是不是被骗了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
